<title>USA: W.R. Grace sells ADM cocoa business for $470 mln.</title>
<headline>W.R. Grace sells ADM cocoa business for $470 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.R. Grace &amp; Co said Friday it completed the sale of its worldwide cocoa business to Archer Daniels Midland Co for more than $470 million, consisting of cash and the assumption of debt.</p>
<p>Grace Cocoa is a global producer of high-quality industrial cocoa and chocolate products,  with operations in Europe, North and South America, Africa and Asia Pacific.</p>
<p>ADM is one of the world's largest processors of agricultural crops.</p>
</text>
